From 58b8160f6df58607a0fd09a7c3f184a1f44de807 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sardi-dev <134648583+sardi-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:30:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/25] Rework the Temple of Kotmogu rules

The battleground gave every team the same points on a timer, whether or
not anyone held an orb, and had no time limit. Now each orb carrier
scores for its team every 5 seconds, 3 points on the outer field, 4 in
the middle ring and 5 in the centre, a kill gives 10 points, and the
match ends at 1600 points or after 25 minutes, when the higher score
wins and a tie goes to the team that scored last. The orb goes back to
its pedestal when its carrier dies, leaves or loses the aura, and the
aura grows stronger every 15 seconds. Dead players now start from the
graveyards of their own team, and the winners get the kill credit of
the map.

The carrier spells were paired with the wrong orb colours, so each orb
now uses the spell its game object names. The achievements of the map
are left out, their criteria types are not implemented.

Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8.
